                                                "sense_id": "613b1b50-8a0d-3cb5-b5d2-3d3efa0870a3",
                                                "text": "Without urgent action, the majority of the Earth’s topsoil could be severely degraded or lost before the end of this century. In China, topsoil is being lost fifty-seven times faster than this natural replacement process; in Europe seventeen times faster."
