                                                "sense_id": "b0676aee-4727-3a20-a350-0075836d8acb",
                                                "text": "HAving given you an Account of the way of ordering of Meadows, Paſtures and Arable Land, with ſeveral Sorts of Improvement of them ; I ſhall in the next place proceed to give an Account of the ſeveral ways uſed to improve Land by Manure, Dung, and other Sort of Soils."
